 Mask Builder, Mask Editor, Thickness:** I found no Designer mask generator pages for these.\n\nThe Painter documentation also describes generators such as Dirt, Fiber Glass Edge Wear, and Metal Edge Wear as the same kinds of tools. Designer's own generator pages say they are similar to Smart Masks in Painter. For a complete, current list, check the Mask Generators section of the Substance 3D Designer documentation on Experience League.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"57eeefc8-4089-4e69-9bb7-23dc4644961d","timestamp":"2026-10-11T14:26:18.930Z","serverClassifierContext":{"request":"25ae5f68-b9e3-44ae-97e5-cd36af29e0bd","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/zenray/.claude/Memory1","root":null,"branch":null,"default_branch":null,"status":null,"visibility":null,"error":"pending"},"live_cwd":"/Users/zenray/.claude/Memory1","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"1734a504-adac-4fa9-b2cf-08254d3939ff","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"user_permanent","reasonType":"rule"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/zenray/.claude/Memory1","sessionId":"3a9c2407-7dcc-4acd-baf2-90a94300e953","version":"2.1.295","gitBranch":"main"}
