{"parentUuid":"f91486a7-b140-48e9-a185-587d02841ff6","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"f51e2112-0260-44ed-9b89-c69d1eac8b4d","agentId":"a30145bc0fb1a513e","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014oj7iwPcns2EozM6BYJZgk","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Javier Perez Gnomon Workshop Substance Designer course materials tutorial instructor\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Javier Perez - Lead Material Artist at PlayStation Studios ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/javier-perez-33559442/\"},{\"title\":\"Introduction to Substance Designer - Intro\",\"url\":\"https://www.artstation.com/learning/courses/r9/introduction-to-substance-designer\"},{\"title\":\"Javier Perez - Gnomon\",\"url\":\"https://www.gnomon.edu/academics/instructors/javier-perez/\"},{\"title\":\"Introduction to Substance with Javier Perez - ArtStation Magazine\",\"url\":\"https://magazine.artstation.com/2019/08/substance-javier/\"},{\"title\":\"Substance Designer Essentials\",\"url\":\"https://www.learnsquared.com/courses/substance-designer-essentials\"},{\"title\":\"The Gnomon Workshop\",\"url\":\"https://www.thegnomonworkshop.com/\"},{\"title\":\"Javier Perez - Lead Material Artist - Learn Squared - Substance Designer Essentials\",\"url\":\"https://www.meshmodeler.com/projects/baL2xm?album_id=869817\"},{\"title\":\"The Gnomon Workshop\",\"url\":\"https://yager.thegnomonworkshop.com/\"},{\"title\":\"Learn Squared\",\"url\":\"https://gfxfather.com/learn-squared-substance-designer-essentials-by-javier-perez/\"}]\n\nI didn't find a Gnomon Workshop tutorial by Javier Perez that is specifically about Substance Designer. The results show him teaching Substance Designer at Gnomon's school program and in other online courses.\n\n**Gnomon (school program):** His Gnomon instructor profile lists a course called Texturing and Shading for Games 2, described as covering advanced texture and material creation in Substance Designer and Unreal. Javier Perez has 11+ years of experience in creating game-ready assets. He has worked at AAA game companies producing games like The Last of Us Part I and II, Call of Duty, and Metal Gear Online. A Gnomon course listing also names him as instructor for Texturing and Shading for Games 2, with software including Unreal Engine, Maya, and Substance 3D Designer and Painter. Gnomon Courses: Texturing and Shading 2 for Games, Game Creation 3 Instructors: Javier Perez, Brian J (the listing is cut off).\n\n**Other Substance Designer courses by him:**\n- **Introduction to Substance Designer (ArtStation Learning):** A beginner course in which he covers the interface and panels of the software. In this beginner-level course, Javier Perez will take you through the UI Elements in Substance Designer.\n- **Substance Designer Essentials (Learn Squared):** A course of about 18 hours. It covers the basics, including the Tile Sampler node, and hard-surface modeling. The course is listed as Beginner, 17h 58m, 95 videos, at $74 with lifetime access. Students finish able to create node networks, troubleshoot, and render final materials in UE4 and Marmoset.\n\n**Caveat:** The Gnomon Workshop's own site (thegnomonworkshop.com) appeared in results, but none of the snippets showed a Javier Perez Substance Designer title there. Gnomon's school instructor page and The Gnomon Workshop online catalog are separate offerings, so check the Gnomon Workshop catalog directly if you need that specific product. Searching the catalog for his name would confirm it.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"fb7e0ccb-9d89-46f6-b656-f9cc18b5edc3","timestamp":"2026-10-11T14:29:01.396Z","serverClassifierContext":{"request":"c908b4ed-c5e8-4a82-ae36-7d92b0715855","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/zenray/.claude/Memory1","root":null,"branch":null,"default_branch":null,"status":null,"visibility":null,"error":"pending"},"live_cwd":"/Users/zenray/.claud