{"parentUuid":"5349bf68-1b68-41f8-b48c-391b8d21a4a1","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"f51e2112-0260-44ed-9b89-c69d1eac8b4d","agentId":"a30145bc0fb1a513e","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VcqbHU63JupD1mDvg7r2cC","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Javier Perez \"Cobblestone Ground\" free tutorial Substance Designer\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"creating cobblestones and clover in substance designer\",\"url\":\"https://80.lv/articles/creating-cobblestones-and-clover-in-substance-designer\"},{\"title\":\"course substance designer essentials\",\"url\":\"https://80.lv/articles/course-substance-designer-essentials\"},{\"title\":\"Substance Designer : formez-vous gratuitement avec Javier Perez\",\"url\":\"https://3dvf.com/substance-designer-formez-vous-gratuitement-avec-javier-perez/\"},{\"title\":\"Introduction to Substance with Javier Perez\",\"url\":\"https://magazine.artstation.com/2019/08/substance-javier/\"},{\"title\":\"Introduction to Substance with Javier Perez\",\"url\":\"https://magazine.artstation.com/?p=22096\"},{\"title\":\"ArtStation Learning: Learn How to Create a Sci-Fi Environment in Substance Designer\",\"url\":\"https://magazine.artstation.com/2020/03/artstationlearning-msi-environmentsubstancedesigner/\"},{\"title\":\"Website powered by\",\"url\":\"https://kaikizzle.artstation.com/projects/Nq4QGP\"},{\"title\":\"Learn for Free\",\"url\":\"https://www.learnsquared.com/courses/substance-designer-essentials/1?video=2714\"},{\"title\":\"The Learn Squared Podcast – Episode 13: Javier Perez\",\"url\":\"https://blog.learnsquared.com/?p=562\"},{\"title\":\"The Learn Squared Podcast – Episode 13: Javier Perez\",\"url\":\"https://blog.learnsquared.com/courses/how-i-became-a-substance-designer-wizard/\"}]\n\nI couldn't find a free tutorial by Javier Perez specifically titled \"Cobblestone Ground\" in these results. Here's what came up that's closest to your request:\n\n- **Javier Perez's free Substance Designer series (2020):** A French trade site reports that Javier Perez, senior Material Artist at PlayStation VASG, put online a series of tutorials around Substance Designer, in partnership with NVIDIA. It adds that the complete series will eventually be gathered on a page of his site, and it counts 12 parts. The article's links aren't in the results, so I couldn't check whether a cobblestone lesson is among the 12.\n- **A free Javier Perez course on ArtStation:** His ArtStation Learning course, Introduction to Substance, takes you step-by-step through the UI basics. It's aimed at beginners.\n- **Learn Squared's free first lesson:** Javier teaches Learn Squared's Substance Designer Essentials course, and signing up for a free account gives instant access to the first lesson of every course. That lesson covers the basics of Substance Designer, and it's about bricks and concrete tiles, not cobblestones.\n- **A cobblestone tutorial by someone else:** An ArtStation project titled \"Cobblestone Wall - Free Tutorial\" describes a fully procedural cobblestone wall material created in Substance Designer. The page doesn't name Javier Perez as the author, so I can't confirm who made it. It links to a YouTube video: https://youtu.be/YehD1nP9-rg\n- **A cobblestone breakdown by a different artist:** An 80.lv article covers a full breakdown of her procedural Cobblestone material: stones, ground, and vegetation creation. The author is Vasilina Sirotina, not Javier Perez, but it covers the ground layer you asked about.\n\nTo find the exact video, I'd check Javier Perez's ArtStation page or YouTube channel for the 12-part series, or search his name with \"cobblestone\" on YouTube.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"a5224d45-186e-431a-8b34-5e86ac1c0082","timestamp":"2026-10-11T14:35:47.031Z","serverClassifierContext":{"request":"2515debc-7e3d-4926-911f-b735c685c2ec","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/