 nodes, plus Distance.\n- **Distance node alternative:** SideFX suggests using the Feather COP or Extrapolate Boundaries COP to clean up edge outlines, since Substance's Distance node can produce ragged results in a common edge-then-flood-fill workflow.\n- **Feather COP walkthrough:** The page gives step-by-step instructions starting from a Tile Pattern COP wired into a Feather COP, with Feather Direction set to Circle for smoother results. It also notes how to expand and shrink shapes with the same node.\n\nA Houdini 20.5 version of the same page also exists, and the search results include a Japanese-language version of it. I didn't open the full pages, so this summary is based on the search excerpts, which cut off partway through the Feather COP example.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"8f2a9750-8ba0-4bf4-acf4-47f54762819e","timestamp":"2026-10-11T14:43:54.707Z","serverClassifierContext":{"request":"5f118937-8e86-40a4-a633-12e6e7804bc9","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/zenray/.claude/Memory1","root":"/Users/zenray/.claude/Memory1","branch":"main","default_branch":"main","status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":18,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"matthieuhuguet/Memory","visibility":"private"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"matthieuhuguet/Memory","visibility":"private"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"matthieuhuguet/Memory","visibility":"private"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/zenray/.claude/Memory1","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"88888784-9ca5-46d3-843b-ebb076120661","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"user_permanent","reasonType":"rule"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/zenray/.claude/Memory1","sessionId":"3a9c2407-7dcc-4acd-baf2-90a94300e95