{"parentUuid":"61b962a2-3a86-480a-bdcc-fbb4a60d7d14","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"f51e2112-0260-44ed-9b89-c69d1eac8b4d","agentId":"a30145bc0fb1a513e","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011tHBM6kzBhcAz3MnFHM43g","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Gnomon Workshop Javier Perez Substance Designer workshop OR tutorial thegnomonworkshop.com\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Monday, October 8th, 2018 Posted by Jim Thacker\",\"url\":\"https://www.cgchannel.com/?p=97672\"},{\"title\":\"Get Ready for Substance Day at Gnomon\",\"url\":\"https://80.lv/articles/001agt-get-ready-for-substance-day-at-gnomon/\"},{\"title\":\"001agt get ready for substance day at gnomon\",\"url\":\"https://80.lv/articles/001agt-get-ready-for-substance-day-at-gnomon/?amp=1\"},{\"title\":\"Log inBy Category\",\"url\":\"https://origin.thegnomonworkshop.com/blog/substance-day-los-angeles-2018\"},{\"title\":\"javier perez\",\"url\":\"https://www.gnomon.edu/academics/instructors/javier-perez\"},{\"title\":\"Substance Day Los Angeles 2018\",\"url\":\"https://magazine.artstation.com/?p=18299\"},{\"title\":\"Substance Day Los Angeles 2018\",\"url\":\"https://magazine.artstation.com/2018/10/substance-day-los-angeles-2018/\"},{\"title\":\"www.viewconference.it\",\"url\":\"https://www.viewconference.it/article/501\"},{\"title\":\"Meet Mat 5 - The Texturing Contest\",\"url\":\"https://www.therookies.co/contests/groups/meet-mat-5/judges/300\"},{\"title\":\"blog.learnsquared.com\",\"url\":\"https://blog.learnsquared.com/tag/tlou2/\"}]\n\nI found one Gnomon course by Javier Perez, plus an older Gnomon event where he gave a Substance Designer masterclass. I didn't find a standalone Gnomon Workshop tutorial page for him in these results.\n\n**Current Gnomon course:** Gnomon's instructor page lists him for Texturing and Shading for Games 2, described as a course that teaches advanced techniques for building textures and materials in Substance Designer and Unreal. The same page says he has 11+ years of experience in creating game-ready assets and credits work on The Last of Us Part I and II, Call of Duty, and Metal Gear Online.\n\n**Past Gnomon masterclass (2018):** At Substance Day Los Angeles 2018, held at Gnomon's Hollywood campus, he gave a Substance Designer session in which he walks through his process for creating a Viking axe in Substance Designer. The session was billed as a walkthrough of his workflow, tips, and tricks, and he was listed at that time as Senior Material Artist at Intrepid Studios.\n\n**Other teaching:** A later speaker bio says Javier shares his passion for Substance Designer by teaching at Laguna College of Art and Design and Gnomon School of Visual Arts, as well as speaking at industry events like GDC. Another bio lists a 2026 VIEW Conference workshop, \"Rocks & Forest: Creating Realistic Terrain in Substance Designer,\" with his job title given as Senior Material Artist at PlayStation.\n\n**Job titles vary by source:** The bios disagree on his title and employer, which reflects different points in his career. The 2018 event listed Intrepid Studios, a later bio lists Lead Material Artist at PlayStation Studios, and the Gnomon page lists several roles. Check the source you rely on for his current title.\n\nTo find the Gnomon Workshop tutorial itself, search the thegnomonworkshop.com catalog directly for his name or for \"Texturing and Shading for Games.\" I can run a narrower search on that if you want.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"fe677c48-3382-45c3-bb56-265153b41c5b","timestamp":"2026-10-11T15:00:22.313Z","serverClassifierContext":{"request":"65f0c851-a2c0-482d-b6c4-d08c4311095b","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/zenray/.claude/Memory1","root":"/Users/zenray/.claude/Memory1","branch":"main","default_branch":"main","status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":24,"untracked":null,"untracked_n